<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.2 </span>Detailed Results</h3>

<figure id="A3.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>
Comparative evaluation of multiple vision-language models across real, synthetic, and textual modalities on four tasks. The best-performing result is highlighted in <span id="A3.T5.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>, and the second-best is <span id="A3.T5.9" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>. Note that ER, RU, KG, and VR denote <span id="A3.T5.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">entity recognition</span>, <span id="A3.T5.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">relation understanding</span>, <span id="A3.T5.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">knowledge grounding</span>, and <span id="A3.T5.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">visual reasoning</span>. </figcaption>
