<span id="A3.F15.pic1.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.49em;">
<span id="A3.F15.pic1.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F15.pic1.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Examples:</span></span>
<span id="A3.I15" class="ltx_itemize" style="--ltx-enum-leftmargin:1em;">
<span id="A3.I15.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I15.i1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">•</span></span> 
<span id="A3.I15.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A3.I15.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The newly discovered moon is connected to its elliptical orbit around Neptune.</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I15.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I15.i2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">•</span></span> 
<span id="A3.I15.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A3.I15.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The blue alpha-helices are connected to beta-sheets through loop regions.</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I15.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I15.i3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">•</span></span> 
<span id="A3.I15.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A3.I15.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The amine group <math id="A3.I15.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{(}\text{\hskip 1.29167pt--\hskip 1.29167pt}\text{NH}{\vphantom{\text{X}}}_{\smash[t]{\text{2}}}\text{)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mtext>(</mtext><mtext> – </mtext><mtext>NH</mtext></mrow><mtext>2</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{(}\text{\hskip 1.29167pt--\hskip 1.29167pt}\text{NH}{\vphantom{\text{X}}}_{\smash[t]{\text{2}}}\text{)}</annotation></semantics></math> is added to the benzene ring at a new position.</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I15.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I15.i4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">•</span></span> 
<span id="A3.I15.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A3.I15.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Each yellow triangular face is attached to three m